===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|tomorwe}}, {{m|enm|tomorwen}}, from {{inh|en|ang|tō morgne||tomorrow|pos=adverb}}, from {{m|ang|tō||at, on}} + {{m|ang|morgen|morgne}} (dative of {{m|ang|morgen||morning}}), from {{der|en|gem-pro|*murganaz||morning}}, perhaps from {{der|en|ine-pro|*mergʰ-||to blink, to twinkle}}, equivalent to {{prefix|en|to|morrow}}.

